haring\" section (or the P0/P2\nscope boundaries list) alongside `cpt-cf-mini-chat-fr-chat-streaming` and\n`cpt-cf-mini-chat-fr-file-upload` so the deferred group chat feature is\ncross-referenced for traceability.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>🧹 Nitpick comments (3)</summary><blockquote>\n\n<details>\n<summary>modules/mini-chat/docs/DESIGN.md (3)</summary><blockquote>\n\n`340-435`: **Add language tags to fenced code blocks for SSE event examples.**\n\nMultiple fenced code blocks in the SSE Event Definitions section (lines 340-435) are missing language identifiers, triggering MD040 warnings. These appear to be SSE protocol examples. Add language tags to improve rendering and satisfy markdownlint:\n\n- Lines 340-346: Add `text` or `http` tag\n- Lines 357-362: Add `text` or `http` tag  \n- Lines 375-377: Add `json` tag\n- Lines 399-402: Add `json` tag\n- Lines 417-420: Add `json` tag\n- Lines 431-434: Add `json` tag\n\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>♻️ Example fix</summary>\n\n````diff\n-```\n+```text\n event: delta\n data: {\"type\": \"text\", \"content\": \"partial text\"}\n ```\n\n-```\n+```json\n event: done\n data: {\"message_id\": \"uuid\", \"usage\": {...}}\n ```\n````\n</details>\n\n---\n\n`1267-1276`: **Add language tag to quota counting flow pseudocode.**\n\nThe quota counting flow code block at lines 1267-1276 is missing a language tag. Add `text` or `pseudocode` to satisfy MD040.\n\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>♻️ Proposed fix</summary>\n\n````diff\n-```\n+```text\n Preflight (reserve) (before LLM call):\n   estimate = tokens(ContextPlan) + max_output_tokens\n   ...\n ```\n````\n</details>\n\n---\n\n`1284-1286`: **Add language tags to provider metadata examples.**\n\nTwo JSON code blocks in the Provider Request Metadata section are missing language tags:\n- Lines 1284-1286: `user` field example\n- Lines 1295-1305: `metadata` object example\n\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>♻️ Proposed fix</summary>\n\n````diff\n-```\n+```json\n \"user\": \"{tenant_id}:{user_id}\"\n ```\n\n-```json  \n+```json\n {\n   \"metadata\": {\n     ...\n   }\n }\n ```\n````\n\nNote: The second block already has `json` tag, so only the first needs fixing.\n</details>\n\n\nAlso applies to: 1295-1305\n\n</blockquote></details>\n\n</blockquote></details>\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit for review status -->","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/626#pullrequestreview-3808113355","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/626","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/626#pullrequestreview-3808113355"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/626"}},"submitted_at":"2026-02-16T11:35:30Z","commit_id":"784b08a03c4d80002cb4b0461ad085da4189dd68"},{"id":3808789521,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOPaLyBs7jBYQR","user":{"login":"coderabbitai[bot]","id":136622811,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCCSy2w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/347564?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/coderabbitai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","sit