\n+        let id = Uuid::new_v4();\n+\n+        let upstream = Upstream {\n+            id,\n+            tenant_id,\n+            alias: String::new(),\n+            server: req.server.clone(),","path":"modules/system/oagw/oagw/src/domain/services/management.rs","commit_id":"04cea814632df97d508624362a221003b4b2f36e","original_commit_id":"9deec0b2c8887c2eea31867a016943e4187fb623","user":{"login":"hyphen-2025","id":248559081,"node_id":"U_kgDODtC16Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/248559081?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyphen-2025","html_url":"https://github.com/hyphen-2025","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyphen-2025/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyphen-2025/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyphen-2025/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyphen-2025/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyphen-2025/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyphen-2025/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyphen-2025/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyphen-2025/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyphen-2025/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I found no validation of `req.server`\nIf this is the case,  any authenticated tenant can configure upstreams to internal or metadata IPs, turning OAGW into a generic SSRF proxy.","created_at":"2026-02-17T23:33:33Z","updated_at":"2026-02-17T23:33:46Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/624#discussion_r2819575665","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/624","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2819575665"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/624#discussion_r2819575665"},"